=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# updates screen-debian-installer ------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Mock: Auto Updates. web-01.example.net runs Debian 13. As$
# debian-installer leaves it without the task: no unattended-$
# upgrades, no APT::Periodic file. Enable installs the package,$
# whose postinst turns updates on by itself (debconf's default),$
# then writes hardn's file.$
$
# Auto Updates #################################################$
$
  [ ] Auto Updates         Not Configured no unattended-upgrades$
$
# Update Configuration -----------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] unattended-upgrades  Not installed$
  [ ] Upgrades             Off unset$
  [ ] Package Lists        Off unset$
   -  Upgrade Timer        On apt-daily-upgrade.timer$
   -  Lists Timer          On apt-daily.timer$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Enable automatic updates$
      Install unattended-upgrades$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-1 or q]:$
$
$

